{"task_id": "HumanEval/89", "solution": "def encrypt(s):\n    \"\"\"Encrypts a string using a Caesar cipher, shifting alphabetic characters by 4 positions, preserving case, and leaving non-alphabetic characters unchanged.\"\"\"\n    SHIFT_AMOUNT = 4\n    encrypted_chars = []\n\n    for char in s:\n        if 'a' <= char <= 'z':\n            start = ord('a')\n            shifted_char_code = (ord(char) - start + SHIFT_AMOUNT) % 26 + start\n            encrypted_chars.append(chr(shifted_char_code))\n        elif 'A' <= char <= 'Z':\n            start = ord('A')\n            shifted_char_code = (ord(char) - start + SHIFT_AMOUNT) % 26 + start\n            encrypted_chars.append(chr(shifted_char_code))\n        else:\n            encrypted_chars.append(char)\n            \n    return \"\".join(encrypted_chars)"}
