{"task_id": "HumanEval/158", "solution": "def find_max(words):\n    \"\"\"Finds the word with the maximum number of unique characters.\n    In case of a tie, returns the lexicographically smallest word.\"\"\"\n    if not words:\n        return \"\"\n\n    max_unique_count = -1\n    result_word = \"\"\n\n    for word in words:\n        # Calculate unique character count for the current word.\n        current_unique_count = len(set(word))\n\n        if current_unique_count > max_unique_count:\n            max_unique_count = current_unique_count\n            result_word = word\n        elif current_unique_count == max_unique_count:\n            # Tie-breaker: choose the lexicographically smallest word.\n            if not result_word or word < result_word:\n                result_word = word\n    return result_word"}
