{"task_id": "HumanEval/161", "solution": "def solve(s):\n    \"\"\"Reverses letter case or the entire string based on letter presence.\n    If no letters are present, the entire string is reversed; otherwise, letter cases are flipped.\"\"\"\n\n    # Determine if the string contains any alphabetic characters.\n    contains_letters = False\n    for char in s:\n        if char.isalpha():\n            contains_letters = True\n            break\n\n    if not contains_letters:\n        # If no letters are found, reverse the entire string.\n        return s[::-1]\n    else:\n        # If letters are found, reverse the case of each letter, keeping non-letters unchanged.\n        transformed_chars = []\n        for char in s:\n            if char.isalpha():\n                transformed_chars.append(char.swapcase())\n            else:\n                transformed_chars.append(char)\n        return \"\".join(transformed_chars)"}
